The following commit has been merged into the sched/core branch of tip:

Commit-ID:     5186ef36909c792591fda7a1ae2afc168f60bc90
Gitweb:        https://git.kernel.org/tip/5186ef36909c792591fda7a1ae2afc168f60bc90
